cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "eventfulranges"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ledentsov
    given-names: Dmitry
    website: "https://github.com/d-led"
repository-code: "https://github.com/d-led/eventfulranges"
license: MPL-2.0
abstract: >-
  A CRDT for real-valued ranges: any number of replicas add and remove ranges on
  their own, and every replica that has seen the same operations converges on
  the same set, in any arrival order.
keywords:
  - CRDT
  - eventual consistency
  - ranges
  - Go
